 on June 22, 2023 (as amended, the “SEPA”), whereby the Company had the right, but not the obligation, to sell to Yorkville up to $125.0 million of shares of its Common Stock at its request any time until February 11, 2026, subject to certain conditions.","context":"Standby Equity Purchase Agreement","section":"Segment Information","block":401,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001819493-26-000054","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001819493","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819493/000181949326000054/xos-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/222f2ea83b0825cdb2a3cdedd09e3ba4cb163b034dcd359497223c1adb50cd34.bin","sha256":"222f2ea83b0825cdb2a3cdedd09e3ba4cb163b034dcd359497223c1adb50cd34"}},{"id":"e4c132439080970b575603f27d7e910805ffc0b951c455ed058555c9e75cdb49","quote":"As consideration for Yorkville’s commitment to purchase shares of Common Stock at the Company’s direction upon the terms and subject to the conditions set forth in the SEPA, upon execution of the SEPA, the Company issued 619 shares of Common Stock to Yorkville.","context":"On March 23, 2022, the Company entered into a Standby Equity Purchase Agreement with YA II PN, Ltd. (“Yorkville”), which was subsequently amended on June 22, 2023 (as amended, the “SEPA”), whereby the Company had the right, but not the obligation, to sell to Yorkville up to $125.0 million of shares of its Common Stock at its request any time until February 11, 2026, subject to certain conditions.","section":"Segment Information","block":402,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001819493-26-000054","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-13","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001819493","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819493/000181949326000054/xos-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/222f2ea83b082